s a cuneiform inscription (in Urartian) [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odzaberd]; The stele says the Urartian king Rusa I founded the place [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odzaberd]; The foundation was in honor of the weather god Theispas [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odzaberd]; The purpose was to cow the enemies of Biaina [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odzaberd]"}]'::jsonb),
